<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Bank Austria buy of Creditanstalt.</title>
<headline>EU clears Bank Austria buy of Creditanstalt.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday it had cleared Bank Austria's acquisition of Creditanstalt.</p>
</text>
